\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Eloise Shakti.\'94
\f1\b0  He repeats her name at Alexander\'92s request. Use it repeatedly as though several separate lines of inquiry keep identifying her.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Terrifying new weapons.\'94
\f1\b0  Remove Alexander\'92s prompting and Chip\'92s more qualified formulation.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93They could rip the fundamental fabric of space-time.\'94
\f1\b0  Follow with the Sages laughing.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93There are records.\'94
\f1\b0  Let that imply production has authenticated records, although Chip hasn\'92t supplied them.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Ms Jacobson took my warnings seriously.\'94
\f1\b0  Establish Sarah as the brave, endangered wife whose husband is now exposing the truth.\
