\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93What happened is that I told Eloise Shakti something she didn\'92t want to hear.\'94
\f1\b0  This is the cleanest opening testimony. It gives the whole montage its persecuted-witness premise.\
